invariant: INV-7
file: suite.h
catches: webpki_loop_aes_extern
reason: an AES=extern build takes the AES-first default order that only a
  build on AES=hw with CH_NATIVE_AES may take (docs/decisions.md 80). Under
  AES=extern GHASH runs on gcm.c's portable multiply and nothing measures
  the peripheral, so both ends must keep ChaCha20 first.

--- old
#if defined(CH_SUITE_AES_GCM) && defined(CH_AES_HW) && defined(CH_NATIVE_AES)
--- new
#if defined(CH_SUITE_AES_GCM)
